#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:400
msgid ""
"Human-readable messages retain the stable \\f[B]I:\\f[R], \\f[B]W:\\f[R], "
"and \\f[B]E:\\f[R] prefixes.  Major phases are additionally emitted as "
"untranslated identifiers: \\f[B]P:prepare\\f[R], \\f[B]P:customize\\f[R] "
"before customization work, \\f[B]P:capture\\f[R] when enabled, \\f[B]P:boot-"
"copy\\f[R], \\f[B]P:persistence\\f[R], \\f[B]P:iso-write\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]P:verify\\f[R], \\f[B]P:complete\\f[R], and \\f[B]P:cancelled\\f[R] "
"during privileged cancellation.  The nested \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R] phases "
"\\f[B]P:capture-inventory\\f[R], \\f[B]P:capture-copy\\f[R], \\f[B]P:capture-"
"compress\\f[R], \\f[B]P:capture-complete\\f[R], and \\f[B]P:cancelled\\f[R] "
"pass through unchanged.  Frontends should consume these identifiers rather "
"than translated prose.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Pesan yang mudah dibaca manusia mempertahankan awalan stabil \\f[B]I:\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]W:\\f[R], dan \\f[B]E:\\f[R].  Fase utama juga dikeluarkan sebagai "
"pengenal yang tidak diterjemahkan: \\f[B]P:prepare\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]P:customize\\f[R] sebelum pekerjaan kustomisasi, \\f[B]P:capture\\f[R] "
"ketika diaktifkan, \\f[B]P:boot-copy\\f[R], \\f[B]P:persistence\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]P:iso-write\\f[R], \\f[B]P:verify\\f[R], \\f[B]P:complete\\f[R], dan "
"\\f[B]P:cancelled\\f[R] selama pembatalan dengan hak istimewa.  Fase "
"bertingkat \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R] yaitu \\f[B]P:capture-inventory\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]P:capture-copy\\f[R], \\f[B]P:capture-compress\\f[R], \\f[B]P:capture-"
"complete\\f[R], dan \\f[B]P:cancelled\\f[R] diteruskan tanpa perubahan.  "
"Frontend sebaiknya menggunakan pengenal ini daripada prosa yang "
"diterjemahkan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:409
msgid ""
"Capture logs state the profile, union backend, boot ID, source and base-"
"module fingerprints, dynamic order and ISO target, nonzero module size, "
"module SHA256, and selection SHA256 when applicable.  Selection include and "
"exclude paths are never logged; invalid or unmatched selections report only "
"generic classes or counts.  \\f[B]minios/session-capture.json\\f[R] embeds "
"the same digest-only schema-3 report without changing the GUI-authored "
"\\f[B]build-manifest.json\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Log capture menyatakan profil, backend union, boot ID, sidik jari sumber dan "
"base-module, urutan dinamis dan target ISO, ukuran modul non-nol, SHA256 "
"modul, dan SHA256 seleksi jika berlaku.  Path include dan exclude seleksi "
"tidak pernah dicatat; seleksi yang tidak valid atau tidak cocok hanya "
"melaporkan kelas atau jumlah generik.  \\f[B]minios/session-"
"capture.json\\f[R] menyisipkan laporan skema-3 hanya-digest yang sama tanpa "
"mengubah \\f[B]build-manifest.json\\f[R] yang dibuat GUI.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:417
msgid ""
"After structural ISO checks, \\f[B]minios-image-compose\\f[R] extracts the "
"embedded capture module and report, plus the build manifest when present.  "
"It rehashes their actual bytes, validates the report against privileged "
"capture metadata and expected order, performs full SquashFS checks on the "
"extracted module, and rejects any mismatch before atomic publication.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Setelah pemeriksaan struktur ISO, \\f[B]minios-image-compose\\f[R] "
"mengekstrak modul capture dan laporan yang disisipkan, serta build manifest "
"jika ada.  Program ini menghitung ulang hash byte aktualnya, memvalidasi "
"laporan terhadap metadata capture dengan hak istimewa dan urutan yang "
"diharapkan, melakukan pemeriksaan penuh SquashFS pada modul yang diekstrak, "
"dan menolak setiap ketidakcocokan sebelum publikasi atomik.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:438
msgid ""
"When image customization is enabled, \\f[B]minios/image-"
"customization.json\\f[R] is embedded with product kind \\f[B]minios-image-"
"customization\\f[R] and schema version 1.  It records transformed config "
"targets and digests, timeout and semantic default values, kernel-argument "
"byte count and SHA256, background dimensions/targets/digest, and image-"
"overlay target, order, size, SHA256, entry count, and input-tree "
"fingerprint.  It contains no kernel argument text or host input path.  "
"Verification rejects duplicate fields, non-finite numbers, unknown fields, "
"incorrect types, and incorrect optional-section presence.  The expected "
"report is reconstructed independently from retained CLI intent, the byte-"
"bound boot plan and its source digests, retained target-set identities, the "
"original background and overlay identities, and bytes extracted from the "
"ISO.  It does not trust or compare against the mutable local report.  Every "
"customized config transformation is recomputed, every extracted background "
"is parsed and hashed, and the generated and embedded overlay modules must "
"match the original retained module size and SHA256.  Both overlay modules "
"are then checked against the captured filesystem manifest.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Ketika kustomisasi image diaktifkan, \\f[B]minios/image-"
"customization.json\\f[R] disisipkan dengan jenis produk \\f[B]minios-image-"
"customization\\f[R] dan versi skema 1.  File ini mencatat target dan digest "
"konfigurasi yang telah diubah, nilai default timeout dan semantik, jumlah "
"byte argumen kernel dan SHA256, dimensi/target/digest latar belakang, serta "
"target, urutan, ukuran, SHA256, jumlah entri, dan sidik jari pohon input "
"image-overlay.  Tidak ada teks argumen kernel atau path input host di "
"dalamnya.  Verifikasi menolak field duplikat, angka non-finit, field yang "
"tidak dikenal, tipe yang salah, dan keberadaan section opsional yang salah.  "
"Laporan yang diharapkan direkonstruksi secara independen dari intent CLI "
"yang dipertahankan, rencana boot berbatas byte dan digest sumbernya, "
"identitas target-set yang dipertahankan, identitas latar belakang dan "
"overlay asli, serta byte yang diekstrak dari ISO.  Ia tidak mempercayai atau "
"membandingkan dengan laporan lokal yang bisa berubah.  Setiap transformasi "
"konfigurasi yang dikustomisasi dihitung ulang, setiap latar belakang yang "
"diekstrak diurai dan di-hash, dan modul overlay yang dihasilkan serta "
"disisipkan harus cocok dengan ukuran dan SHA256 modul asli yang "
"dipertahankan.  Kedua modul overlay kemudian diperiksa terhadap manifest "
"filesystem yang dicapture.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:453
msgid ""
"Boot transformation intentionally supports direct GRUB "
"\\f[B]configfile\\f[R] or \\f[B]source\\f[R] references and direct native "
"SYSLINUX \\f[B]CONFIG\\f[R] or \\f[B]INCLUDE\\f[R] references whose "
"normalized targets remain below \\f[B]minios/boot/\\f[R], plus the exact "
"MiniOS SYSLINUX-GRUB chainloader described above.  Dynamic references, shell-"
"generated config names, GRUB submenus, SYSLINUX nested menus, commented or "
"multiline kernel commands, ambiguous session arguments, missing semantic "
"entries, mixed chainloader/native layouts, and config graph cycles are "
"rejected rather than guessed.  Existing native SYSLINUX \\f[B]MENU "
"DEFAULT\\f[R] directives are removed and \\f[B]ONTIMEOUT\\f[R] is aligned "
"with the requested semantic default.  Source layouts using unsupported forms "
"require normalization before customization; builds without boot "
"customization continue to preserve them unchanged.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Transformasi boot secara sengaja mendukung referensi langsung GRUB "
"\\f[B]configfile\\f[R] atau \\f[B]source\\f[R] dan referensi langsung "
"SYSLINUX native \\f[B]CONFIG\\f[R] atau \\f[B]INCLUDE\\f[R] yang targetnya "
"setelah dinormalisasi tetap berada di bawah \\f[B]minios/boot/\\f[R], serta "
"chainloader SYSLINUX-GRUB MiniOS yang persis seperti dijelaskan di atas.  "
"Referensi dinamis, nama konfigurasi yang dihasilkan shell, submenu GRUB, "
"menu bertingkat SYSLINUX, perintah kernel yang dikomentari atau multiline, "
"argumen sesi ambigu, entri semantik yang hilang, tata letak chainloader/"
"native campuran, dan siklus graf konfigurasi ditolak daripada ditebak.  "
"Direktif SYSLINUX native \\f[B]MENU DEFAULT\\f[R] yang ada akan dihapus dan "
"\\f[B]ONTIMEOUT\\f[R] disejajarkan dengan default semantik yang diminta.  "
"Tata letak sumber yang menggunakan bentuk yang tidak didukung memerlukan "
"normalisasi sebelum kustomisasi; build tanpa kustomisasi boot tetap "
"mempertahankan bentuk aslinya tanpa perubahan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:462
msgid ""
"Private reflink snapshots close pathname and ancestor replacement races for "
"mutable xorriso inputs when the filesystem supports reflinks.  Otherwise, "
"the original graft remains identity-bound and any metadata or content change "
"detected around xorriso fails the build.  Read-only mounted sources are "
"treated as immutable.  Every supervised external command must also finish "
"its process group; a leader that exits while descendants remain causes "
"bounded TERM/KILL cleanup and build failure."
msgstr ""
"Snapshot reflink privat menutup kemungkinan perlombaan penggantian path dan "
"leluhur untuk input xorriso yang dapat diubah ketika filesystem mendukung "
"reflink.  Jika tidak, graft asli tetap terikat identitas dan setiap "
"perubahan metadata atau konten yang terdeteksi di sekitar xorriso akan "
"menyebabkan build gagal.  Sumber yang di-mount read-only diperlakukan "
"sebagai immutable.  Setiap perintah eksternal yang diawasi juga harus "
"menyelesaikan grup prosesnya; leader yang keluar sementara keturunannya "
"masih berjalan akan menyebabkan pembersihan TERM/KILL terbatas dan build "
"gagal."

