#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:489
msgid ""
"Interrupted by INT or TERM.  Rootless overlay mksquashfs and its process "
"group are terminated directly.  During privileged capture, the marker is "
"created atomically before direct signal attempts, then the parent waits a "
"bounded interval for savechanges to terminate, reap, and clean its root "
"process group.  Private temporary output is removed through retained "
"descriptors."
msgstr ""
"Dihentikan oleh INT atau TERM. Overlay rootless mksquashfs dan grup "
"prosesnya dihentikan secara langsung. Selama penangkapan dengan hak "
"istimewa, penanda dibuat secara atomik sebelum upaya sinyal langsung, "
"kemudian induk menunggu interval terbatas agar savechanges berhenti, "
"mengambil, dan membersihkan grup proses root-nya. Output sementara privat "
"dihapus melalui deskriptor yang dipertahankan."

